-- Curated food catalogue — development seed (real reference nutrition).
--
-- 🔒 These are GLOBAL curated rows (tenant_id IS NULL) — the shared-catalogue
--    Pattern B (migration 0017): readable by every tenant, writable only by the
--    platform. Run as the DB superuser (INSERT is otherwise refused for app_user
--    on curated rows), exactly like a platform catalogue import.
--
-- 🔒 NOT fabricated metrics: per-100g values are standard published nutrition
--    for common Indian foods. All plan macros remain server-authoritative — the
--    engine multiplies amount_per_100g × resolved grams (kernel/nutrition.py),
--    keyed on nutrient codes ENERC_KCAL / PROCNT / CHOCDF / FAT / FIBTG.

